      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="teamContainer" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Skeletons: replaced once /api/team resolves. -->
      <div class="glass overflow-hidden animate-pulse">
        <div class="h-56 bg-white/[0.06]"></div>
        <div class="p-6"><div class="h-5 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/2 mb-3"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/3 mb-4"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/5 rounded w-full"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="glass overflow-hidden animate-pulse">
        <div class="h-56 bg-white/[0.06]"></div>
        <div class="p-6"><div class="h-5 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/2 mb-3"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/3 mb-4"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/5 rounded w-full"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="glass overflow-hidden animate-pulse">
        <div class="h-56 bg-white/[0.06]"></div>
        <div class="p-6"><div class="h-5 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/2 mb-3"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/10 rounded w-1/3 mb-4"></div><div class="h-3 bg-white/5 rounded w-full"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================== HOW WE WORK ========================== -->
<section class="py-24 border-y border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Our Values</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
        What holds this team <span class="gradient-text">together</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        Four things we agree on, and hire for.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="glass p-7 reveal">
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-comments"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">Say the Hard Thing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          If an idea will not work, we tell you early — even when it is easier to nod along.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-7 reveal">
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">Own the Outcome</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Shipping is not the finish line. We care whether the thing actually works for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-7 reveal">
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-seedling"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">Keep Learning</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Everyone gets time and budget to go deep on the craft, not just bill hours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass p-7 reveal">
        <div class="service-icon mb-5"><i class="fas fa-people-group"></i></div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2.5">No Lone Heroes</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Reviews, pairing and shared context. No single point of failure on any project.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================== CTA ============================== -->
<section class="py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-ink-700 to-ink-900 px-8 py-16 sm:px-16 sm:py-20 text-center reveal">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -top-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[36rem] h-[36rem] bg-brand/20 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mb-5">
          Want This Team <span class="gradient-text">On Your Project?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
          Tell us what you are building. We will come back within 24 hours with honest
          thoughts — and the names of the people who would work on it.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="/contact" class="primary-btn">
            Start a Conversation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs"></i>
          </a>
          <a href="/careers" class="ghost-btn">Join the Team</a>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-400"></i> Senior people only</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-400"></i> No handoffs</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-check text-green-400"></i> 24h response</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // Render the team from the CMS instead of hardcoding cards.
  (() => {
    const container = document.getElementById("teamContainer");
    const FALLBACK_IMG = "<%= siteImages['team.fallback'] %>";

    // API data is user-authored, so it must never reach innerHTML unescaped.
    const escape = (s) => String(s == null ? "" : s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, (c) =>
      ({ "&": "&amp;", "<": "&lt;", ">": "&gt;", '"': "&quot;", "'": "&#39;" }[c]));

    // Only allow http(s) and relative hrefs -- blocks javascript: URLs from the CMS.
    const safeUrl = (u) => {
      const v = String(u == null ? "" : u).trim();
      return /^(https?:\/\/|\/|\.\/|#)/i.test(v) ? v : "";
    };

    const emptyState = (msg) => `
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3">
        <div class="glass p-12 text-center">
          <div class="service-icon mx-auto mb-5"><i class="fas fa-user-group"></i></div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">${escape(msg.title)}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm max-w-sm mx-auto">${escape(msg.body)}</p>
        </div>
      </div>`;

    const socialLink = (url, icon, label) => {
      const href = safeUrl(url);
      if (!href) return "";
      return `<a href="${escape(href)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                 aria-label="${escape(label)}" title="${escape(label)}"
                 class="grid place-items-center w-9 h-9 rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] text-gray-400 hover:text-brand hover:border-brand/40 transition">
                <i class="fab fa-${icon}"></i>
              </a>`;
    };

    fetch("/api/team")
      .then((res) => (res.ok ? res.json() : Promise.reject(new Error(res.status))))
      .then((members) => {
        if (!members.length) {
          container.innerHTML = emptyState({
            title: "No team members yet.",
            body: "Profiles will appear here as soon as they are added from the dashboard.",
          });
          return;
        }

        container.innerHTML = members.map((member) => {
          const img = safeUrl(member.image) || FALLBACK_IMG;
          const social = member.social || {};
          const socials = [
            socialLink(social.twitter, "twitter", member.name + " on Twitter"),
            socialLink(social.linkedin, "linkedin", member.name + " on LinkedIn"),
            socialLink(social.github, "github", member.name + " on GitHub"),
          ].join("");

          const expertise = Array.isArray(member.expertise) ? member.expertise : [];
          const tags = expertise
            .map((t) => String(t).trim())
            .filter(Boolean)
            .slice(0, 4)
            .map((t) => `<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand/10 border border-brand/25 text-brand text-[0.7rem] font-medium">${escape(t)}</span>`)
            .join("");

          return `
            <article class="glass overflow-hidden group reveal" data-member-id="${escape(member.id)}">
              <div class="relative h-56 overflow-hidden">
                <img src="${escape(img)}" alt="${escape(member.name)}" loading="lazy"
                     class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink-900 via-ink-900/25 to-transparent"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-6">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-1 group-hover:text-brand transition">${escape(member.name)}</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-brand font-semibold mb-3">${escape(member.position || "Team Member")}</p>
                ${member.bio ? `<p class="text-sm text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">${escape(member.bio)}</p>` : ""}
                ${tags ? `<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-5">${tags}</div>` : ""}
                ${socials ? `<div class="flex gap-2 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">${socials}</div>` : ""}
              </div>
            </article>`;
        }).join("");

        // Cards are injected after the layout's observer ran, so reveal them here.
        container.querySelectorAll(".reveal").forEach((el) => el.classList.add("visible"));
      })
      .catch((err) => {
        console.error("Error loading team:", err);
        container.innerHTML = emptyState({
          title: "Team is unavailable right now.",
          body: "We could not load our profiles. Please refresh in a moment.",
        });
      });
  })();
</script>
